From b24525952e523151c92a7221c9919678b28f0ff2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nnc's github world <notnoelchannel1@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:43:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] msm8916: Add rossa EUR (SM-G360F) variant

Add msm8916_sec_rossa_eur_defconfig, the rossa-eur-r00/r01 board DTS
with their pinctrl and battery dtsi, and the MACH_ROSSA_EUR_OPEN
Kconfig/Makefile wiring, taken from the SM-G360F stock-based kernel
(notnoelchannel2/android_kernel_samsung_rossa-caf). The EUR camera
sensor dtsi differs from the SPR/TMO one already in this tree, so it is
added as msm8916-camera-sensor-cdp-rossa-eur.dtsi.

All drivers the EUR defconfig enables (SR544, SEC_NFC, SM5504_MUIC,
PANEL_HX8369B_BV045WVM_WVGA, MFD_RT5033_RESET_WA, CHECK_SIMSLOT_COUNT)
already exist in this kernel, as do both panel dtsi directories
(HX8369B_BV045WVM, SC7798A_BV045WVM).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019qCxPg6XTreanWbTn5Qjr6
